Description: Imports line-oriented JavaScript Object Notation (JSON)
    files produced by Illumina Connected Annotations variant
    annotation workflow (former Nirvana). It preserves nested position- and gene-level
    annotations while creating tibbles used by the aPRoVAR analysis workflow.
    Sequential and multisession parsing, compressed RDS input and output, and
    conversion of genomic positions to GenomicRanges objects are provided.
